in Christ Jesus."},{"verse":2,"text":"The things which you have heard from me among many witnesses, commit the same things to faithful men who will be able to teach others also."},{"verse":3,"text":"You therefore must endure hardship as a good soldier of Christ Jesus."},{"verse":4,"text":"No soldier on duty entangles himself in the affairs of life, that he may please him who enrolled him as a soldier."},{"verse":5,"text":"Also, if anyone competes in athletics, he isn’t crowned unless he has competed by the rules."},{"verse":6,"text":"The farmer who labors must be the first to get a share of the crops."},{"verse":7,"text":"Consider what I say, and may the Lord give you understanding in all things."},{"verse":8,"text":"Remember Jesus Christ, risen from the dead, of the offspring of David, according to my Good News,"},{"verse":9,"text":"in which I suffer hardship to the point of chains as a criminal. But God’s word isn’t chained."},{"verse":10,"text":"Therefore I endure all things for the chosen ones’ sake, that they also may obtain the salvation which is in Christ Jesus with eternal glory."},{"verse":11,"text":"This saying is trustworthy: “For if we died with him, we will also live with him."},{"verse":12,"text":"If we endure, we will also reign with him. If we deny him, he also will deny us."},{"verse":13,"text":"If we are faithless, he remains faithful; for he can’t deny himself.”"},{"verse":14,"text":"Remind them of these things, charging them in the sight of the Lord that they don’t argue about words to no profit, to the subverting of those who hear."},{"verse":15,"text":"Give diligence to present yourself approved by God, a workman who doesn’t need to be ashamed, properly handling the Word of Truth."},{"verse":16,"text":"But shun empty chatter, for it will go further in ungodliness,"},{"verse":17,"text":"and those words will consume like gangrene, of whom is Hymenaeus and Philetus:"},{"verse":18,"text":"men who have erred concerning the truth, saying that the resurrection is already past, and overthrowing the faith of some."},{"verse":19,"text":"However, God’s firm foundation stands, having this seal: “The Lord knows those who are his,” and, “Let every one who names the name of the Lord depart from unrighteousness.”"},{"verse":20,"text":"Now in a large house there are not only vessels of gold and of silver, but also of wood and of clay. Some are for honor and some for dishonor."},{"verse":21,"text":"If anyone therefore purges himself from these, he will be a vessel for honor, sanctified, and suitable for the master’s use, prepared for every good work."},{"verse":22,"text":"Flee from youthful lusts; but pursue righteousness, faith, love, and peace with those who call on the Lord out of a pure heart."},{"verse":23,"text":"But refuse foolish and ignorant questionings, knowing that they generate strife."},{"verse":24,"text":"The Lord’s servant must not quarrel, but be gentle toward all, able to teach, patient,"},{"verse":25,"text":"in gentleness correcting those who oppose him. Perhaps God may give them repentance leading to a full knowledge of the truth,"},{"verse":26,"text":"and they may recover themselves out of the devil’s snare, having been taken captive by him to do his will."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/2timothy.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"2timothy_3","bookSlug":"2timothy","chapter":3,"reference":"2 Timothy 3","title":"2 Timothy 3 — Public Domain Study","topics":["2 timothy","2timothy","nt","scripture","提摩太後書","提摩太后书","末世的人性","末世的人性"],"snippet":{"zh-CN":"你该知道，末世必有危险的日子来到。"},"tokens":{"17":2,"55":1,"timothy":7,"public":2,"domain":2,"study":1,"2timothy":2,"nt":1,"scripture":1,"提摩太後書":1,"提摩太后书":2,"末世的人性":2,"你该知道":1,"末世必有危险的日子来到":1,"因为那时":1,"人要专顾自己":1,"贪爱钱财":1,"自夸":2,"狂傲":2,"违背父母":1,"忘恩负义":1,"心不圣洁":1,"无亲情":1,"不解怨":1,"好说谗言":1,"不能自约":1,"性情凶暴":1,"不爱良善":1,"卖主卖友":1,"任意妄为":1,"自高自大":1,"爱宴乐":1,"不爱":3,"有敬虔的外貌":1,"却背了敬虔的实意":1,"这等人你要躲开":1,"那偷进人家":1,"牢笼无知妇女的":1,"正是这等人":1,"这些妇女担负罪恶":1,"被各样的私欲引诱":1,"常常