 God,"},{"verse":5,"text":"holding a form of godliness but having denied its power. Turn away from these, also."},{"verse":6,"text":"For some of these are people who creep into houses and take captive gullible women loaded down with sins, led away by various lusts,"},{"verse":7,"text":"always learning and never able to come to the knowledge of the truth."},{"verse":8,"text":"Even as Jannes and Jambres opposed Moses, so these also oppose the truth, men corrupted in mind, who concerning the faith are rejected."},{"verse":9,"text":"But they will proceed no further. For their folly will be evident to all men, as theirs also came to be."},{"verse":10,"text":"But you followed my teaching, conduct, purpose, faith, patience, love, steadfastness,"},{"verse":11,"text":"persecutions, and sufferings—those things that happened to me at Antioch, Iconium, and Lystra. I endured those persecutions. The Lord delivered me out of them all."},{"verse":12,"text":"Yes, and all who desire to live godly in Christ Jesus will suffer persecution."},{"verse":13,"text":"But evil men and impostors will grow worse and worse, deceiving and being deceived."},{"verse":14,"text":"But you remain in the things which you have learned and have been assured of, knowing from whom you have learned them."},{"verse":15,"text":"From infancy, you have known the holy Scriptures which are able to make you wise for salvation through faith which is in Christ Jesus."},{"verse":16,"text":"Every Scripture is God-breathed and profitable for teaching, for reproof, for correction, and for instruction in righteousness,"},{"verse":17,"text":"that each person who belongs to God may be complete, thoroughly equipped for every good work."}],"hasArtwork":true,"artworkUrl":"/data/images/books/2timothy.svg","availableLangs":["zh-CN"]},{"id":"2timothy_4","bookSlug":"2timothy","chapter":4,"reference":"2 Timothy 4","title":"2 Timothy 4 — Public Domain Study","topics":["2 timothy","2timothy","nt","scripture","提摩太後書","提摩太后书","私事的囑咐","私